 * | ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
 * | `alt=""` -> `alt={product.name}`    | accessible name fails, doubled    |
 * | `role="button"` on the card link    | role fails, reporting button      |
 * | each card rendered twice            | length fails, reporting 2         |
 *
